title,Legal Contract
r0,MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT (SYNTHETIC)
r1,This Agreement is made on 10-12-2024 between Meridian Textiles Pvt Ltd ('Provider') and Fatima Joshi ('Client').
r2,WHEREAS the parties wish to set out terms for professional services;
r3,1. Scope of work as in Exhibit A.
r4,2. Fees payable within 30 days of invoice.
r5,3. Confidentiality and limitation of liability.
r6,4. Governing law: India. Arbitration in Mumbai.
r7,This is a commercial contract; not a title or mortgage deed.
